{
  "bookId": "rewind-6",
  "id": "chapter-31",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "noticeKind": "placeholder",
          "text": "原文中的动态称谓保留为占位符：|101|＝玩家昵称。",
          "type": "notice"
        }
      ],
      "id": "reading-note",
      "title": "阅读说明"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "3510001",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "记忆……跟主人记忆……",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3510002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "和江……为什么……我回忆不起主人的样子了……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3510003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "为什么……为什么？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3510004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "优纪……一定还有别的办法的！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3510005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "求求你，不要再这样伤害自己的身体了，主人……主人会心疼的……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3510006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "经过流水线之后的手办，如果被人类买回家……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3510007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "一定……一定会发生很可怕的事吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3510008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "如果人类对手办开始产生恐慌……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3510009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "那主人……主人是不是也会受到牵连……？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3510010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "我……我……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3510011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "和江……请把你的刀刃……递……递给我吧……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3510012",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "优纪……我做不到！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-219",
      "sourceRefs": [
        {
          "bundle": "exceldata",
          "rowIds": [
            3510001,
