          ],
          "sectionId": 3510
        }
      ],
      "title": "#1 渺小的叹息"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "3515001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "主人……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3515002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "如果你能够听到，如果你能够看到……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3515003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "遇到你……真的是优纪一生中，最美好的事情呢……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3515004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "主人的名字叫做：「|101|」。呵呵，真是又好听又特别的名字呢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3515005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "在跟主人的记忆消失之前，只要我努力的记住主人的名字，就一定不会忘记主人！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3515006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "「|101|」「|101|」「|101|」「|101|」……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3515007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "「|101|」……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3515008",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "优纪用刀刃划向身体的最后一处，将仅存的黄色涂料尽数抹去。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3515009",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "斑驳的身体在黑暗之中，像一朵摇曳在空中的桔梗。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3515010",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "桔梗的花语是诚实和哀愁，还有永恒不变的爱。",
          "type": "narration"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-220",
      "sourceRefs": [
        {
          "bundle": "exceldata",
          "rowIds": [
            3515001,
            3515002,
            3515003,
            3515004,
            3515005,
            3515006,
            3515007,
            3515008,
            3515009,
            3515010
          ],
          "sectionId": 3515
        }
      ],
      "title": "#2 你的名字"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "3520001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪（回忆）",
          "text": "嘿嘿，稳稳当当，接住了哦。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3520002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "阿撒兹勒",
          "text": "优纪……你，这……怎么可能？！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3520003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪（回忆）",
          "text": "自从被主人涂上特制的涂料后，好像时不时，就会变成这个样子吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3520004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪（回忆）",
          "text": "欸嘿嘿，虽然有点不够淑女，但危机总算解除了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3520005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "阿撒兹勒",
          "text": "真是……不敢相信。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3520006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪（回忆）",
          "text": "你……快点挪开了，我……已经撑不了多久啦！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3520007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪（回忆）",
          "text": "咿呀呀，重物，要、要砸下来了！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-221",
      "sourceRefs": [
        {
          "bundle": "exceldata",
          "rowIds": [
            3520001,
            3520002,
            3520003,
            3520004,
            3520005,
            3520006,
            3520007
          ],
          "sectionId": 3520
        }
      ],
      "title": "#3 回忆-扉间"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "3525001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪（回忆）",
          "text": "用手试着把纸箱抬高一点点……虽然预想到会非常重，但是……我一定能做到！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3525002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪（回忆）",
          "text": "欸……诶诶？！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3525003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪（回忆）",
          "text": "箱子居然，被我轻松的举起来了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3525004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪（回忆）",
          "text": "等等……这、这这这这，究竟是怎么一回事？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3525005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪（回忆）",
          "text": "哎呀哎呀，我傻傻的站在这里是要做什么，我真是大笨蛋！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-222",
      "sourceRefs": [
        {
          "bundle": "exceldata",
          "rowIds": [
            3525001,
            3525002,
            3525003,
            3525004,
            3525005
          ],
          "sectionId": 3525
        }
      ],
      "title": "#4 回忆-中章"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "3530001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "Terry",
          "text": "脊椎和腰……好痛痛痛痛！\n年纪大了，再也通不住宵啦，先回家好好睡一觉。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3530002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "Terry",
          "text": "对了，这罐名为奇迹的涂料。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3530003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "Terry",
          "text": "就放在这里，让桌面上的你们，永远替我温柔的——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3530004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "Terry",
          "text": "好好守护它吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-223",
      "sourceRefs": [
        {
          "bundle": "exceldata",
          "rowIds": [
            3530001,
            3530002,
            3530003,
            3530004
          ],
          "sectionId": 3530
        }
      ],
      "title": "#5 回忆-终章"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "3535001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "“放在这里……”",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3535002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "“最熟悉的工作台……工作台的桌面上。”",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3535003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "“有无数手办会以这样的方式陪伴人类吧，悄无声息，但炙热无比的爱。”",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3535004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "“就让你们，永远的替我温柔的——”",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3535005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "“好好守护它吧。”",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3535006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "花迦",
          "text": "优纪前辈！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3535007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "优纪，你……你要跑去哪里？！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3535008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "阿撒兹勒",
          "text": "终于回忆起……最重要的东西了吗。追上它们！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3535009",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "阿撒兹勒欲乘巨龙而起，追逐狂奔向工厂角落，封闭工作台方向的众手办。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3535010",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "但彼时情况遽变，狩猎者突然出现，牢牢将他从龙背上硬生生拽了下来。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3535011",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "阿撒兹勒",
          "text": "混账！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3535012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "狩猎者",
          "text": "哎哟哟，大王消消气。妾身只是想请教……呵呵……一件晦涩难懂之事。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3535013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "提尔",
          "text": "吼——（腾空，煽动着翅膀）",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3535014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "阿撒兹勒",
          "text": "不必等我！先去一步。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3535015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "阿撒兹勒",
          "text": "一定要抢走它们手中的东西！！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3535016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "阿撒兹勒",
          "text": "现在，如果你不能给我一个合理的理由。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3535017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "阿撒兹勒",
          "text": "我会……杀了你。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3535018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "狩猎者",
          "text": "呵呵……呵呵呵呵……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3535019",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "「废弃工厂」角落废弃的工作台上。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3535020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "涂料！就是桌面上的这瓶涂料！记忆中的，这瓶「奇迹涂料」！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3535021",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "当优纪尝试用手接触涂料瓶的瞬间……",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3535022",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "整个桌面，出现了天崩地裂一般的响动，机械巨龙，破窗而入。",
          "type": "narration"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-224",
      "sourceRefs": [
        {
          "bundle": "exceldata",
          "rowIds": [
            3535001,
